\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {A short session is planned during the meeting in Glasgow, in order to give some opportunity to discuss the possible implications of the 2009 SVP meeting in Bristol.  }{\lang1033\langfe1033\langnp1033 
